          "name": "Group Name Hash",
          "type": "UInt",
          "default": "0"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "template<StatDataType = FDefaultStatData,GroupDataType = StatDataType::TGroup> FCheckedStat",
      "docs": "Returns a valid TStatId if we can emit it.\nStatNameHash and GroupNameHash must be calculated at compile time to avoid a very large overhead.\nGroupNameHash can be 0 if the stat has no group or the group is default.\nBoth of these values will be 0 if UE_STATS_ALLOW_PER_THREAD_IGNORELIST is 0."
